---
description: 'Force English language for all UI text and labels'
globs: '**/*'
alwaysApply: true
---

# English Only

All UI text, labels, error messages, and logs must be in English.
Do not use other languages unless explicitly requested by the user.

- Variable names, function names, and comments (if any) should also be in English.
- User-facing text in components (JSX/TSX) must be in English.
